"The privileged helper refused the request. Check the agent's name and account, and use Export Diagnostics in the app to collect the helper's log." = "特权助手拒绝了请求。请检查 Agent 的名称与账号，并使用应用内的“导出诊断信息”收集 helper 日志。";
"The session token does not match this agent. Re-read it from the runtime directory, or recreate the agent." = "会话令牌与该 Agent 不匹配。请从运行时目录重新读取，或重建该 Agent。";
