"Switch back to your own account and click Finish setup on the agent card. AgentSpace can install the worker only after that first login." = "切回你的账号，在 Agent 卡片上点击「完成设置」。只有首次登录后，AgentSpace 才能安装 worker。";
"Sign in to the connected account again if needed, then grant Accessibility and Screen Recording to agentspace-worker in System Settings." = "如有需要，再次登录该账号，然后在系统设置中为 agentspace-worker 授予辅助功能和屏幕录制权限。";
"The privacy prompts cannot appear before the worker starts. Until the first login and Finish setup are complete, the agent remains in Needs Login; AgentSpace never starts it in your account instead." = "worker 启动前不会出现隐私权限提示。在完成首次登录和「完成设置」前，Agent 会保持「需要登录」；AgentSpace 绝不会在你的主账号中启动它。";
"The connected account does not contain a second AgentSpace app. That is intentional: only the background agentspace-worker runs there; use that account's built-in System Settings for its permissions." = "已连接的账号中不会有第二个 AgentSpace 应用，这是有意设计的：那里只运行后台 agentspace-worker；请在该账号自带的系统设置中授予权限。";
"The connected account does not contain a second AgentSpace app. The background agentspace-worker runs there and uses that account's System Settings permissions." = "已连接的账号中不会有第二个 AgentSpace 应用。后台 agentspace-worker 会在那里运行，并使用该账号系统设置中的权限。";
"When you switch to the connected account, its AgentSpace panel is intentionally empty. Use the System Settings opened by these buttons, then switch back to your own account." = "切换到已连接账号后，那里 AgentSpace 面板为空是正常的。请使用这些按钮打开系统设置，完成授权后再切回你的账号。";
"Where accounts, runtime sockets and logs live. Empty means /Library/Application Support/AgentSpace. AGENTSPACE_ROOT is read at launch; restart to apply." = "账号、运行时 socket 和日志的存放位置。留空表示 /Library/Application Support/AgentSpace。AGENTSPACE_ROOT 在启动时读取，重启后生效。";
"In the connected account's session, open System Settings → Privacy & Security → Accessibility and enable agentspace-worker. Then switch back to your account and click Finish setup or Refresh in AgentSpace." = "在已连接账号的会话中，打开「系统设置 → 隐私与安全性 → 辅助功能」，启用 agentspace-worker。然后切回你的账号，在 AgentSpace 中点击「完成设置」或「刷新」。";
"In the connected account's session, open System Settings → Privacy & Security → Screen & System Audio Recording and enable agentspace-worker. Then switch back to your account and click Finish setup or Refresh in AgentSpace." = "在已连接账号的会话中，打开「系统设置 → 隐私与安全性 → 屏幕与系统声音录制」，启用 agentspace-worker。然后切回你的账号，在 AgentSpace 中点击「完成设置」或「刷新」。";
"In the connected account's session, open System Settings → Privacy & Security → Accessibility and enable agentspace-worker. Then switch back and click Finish setup in AgentSpace." = "在已连接账号的会话中，打开「系统设置 → 隐私与安全性 → 辅助功能」，启用 agentspace-worker。然后切回你的账号，在 AgentSpace 中点击「完成设置」。";
"In the connected account's session, open System Settings → Privacy & Security → Screen & System Audio Recording and enable agentspace-worker. Then switch back and click Finish setup in AgentSpace." = "在已连接账号的会话中，打开「系统设置 → 隐私与安全性 → 屏幕与系统声音录制」，启用 agentspace-worker。然后切回你的账号，在 AgentSpace 中点击「完成设置」。";
"These buttons open the privacy pane inside the connected account's session. If you are currently in your own account, click one first, then fast-switch to the connected account to see System Settings there." = "这些按钮会在已连接账号自己的会话中打开隐私设置。如果你当前在自己的账号中，先点击按钮，再通过快速用户切换进入已连接账号，就能在那里看到系统设置。";
"The connected account is running an older worker that does not support this permission button." = "已连接账号正在运行旧版 worker，不支持这个权限按钮。";
"Click Update worker to install the current worker in the connected account, then try the permission button again." = "点击「更新 worker」即可在已连接账号中安装当前版本，然后再次点击权限按钮。";
"Update worker…" = "更新 worker…";
"The helper was reinstalled but is not answering with the current build yet." = "助手已重新安装，但当前版本暂时还没有响应。";
"Try Update worker again after a moment." = "稍等片刻后再次点击「更新 worker」。";
"Open Accessibility settings" = "打开辅助功能设置";
"Open Screen Recording settings" = "打开屏幕录制设置";
"Open authorization guide" = "打开授权向导";
"Authorize this agent" = "授权此 Agent";
"You do not need to find AgentSpace in %@. These buttons open System Settings in that account's own session; switch to %@, approve the permission, then return here." = "你不需要在 %@ 账号里寻找 AgentSpace。下面的按钮会在该账号自己的会话中打开系统设置；切换到 %@，完成授权后再回到这里。";
"Lets agentspace-worker operate the attached desktop." = "允许 agentspace-worker 操作已连接账号的桌面。";
"Lets the worker capture the attached desktop for previews." = "允许 worker 捕获已连接账号的桌面用于预览。";
"Granted" = "已授权";
"Needs approval" = "待授权";
"Open settings" = "打开设置";
"Refresh authorization status" = "刷新授权状态";
"Permissions & authorization" = "权限与授权";
"Authorize %@ here. These buttons open System Settings in that account's own session; you do not need to find AgentSpace after switching users." = "在这里为 %@ 授权。下面的按钮会在该账号自己的会话中打开系统设置；切换用户后不需要寻找 AgentSpace。";
"The permission entry is agentspace-worker. It is a background process, not a separate app to launch or install." = "系统设置中的权限条目是 agentspace-worker。它是后台进程，不是需要单独打开或安装的 App。";
"You do not need to find AgentSpace in %@. The permission entry is agentspace-worker, a background process rather than a separate app. Switch to %@ only to approve it, then return here." = "你不需要在 %@ 中寻找 AgentSpace。权限条目是 agentspace-worker，它是后台进程而不是独立 App。切换到 %@ 只是为了勾选授权，然后返回这里。";
"Permissions for this desktop belong to agentspace-worker, the background process in this account. Use the Permissions & authorization card in the main account's AgentSpace window." = "这个桌面的权限属于该账号中的后台进程 agentspace-worker。请回到主账号的 AgentSpace 窗口，使用「权限与授权」卡片。";
"Preparing authorization…" = "正在准备授权…";
"Use the Permissions & authorization card above. Its buttons install/start the worker when needed, then open the privacy pane inside the connected account's session." = "请使用上方的「权限与授权」卡片。按钮会在需要时安装并启动 worker，然后在已连接账号的会话中打开隐私设置。";
"Sign in to the attached account first. The worker must be running before macOS can show its permission entry." = "请先登录已连接账号。worker 启动后，macOS 才会显示它的权限条目。";
"AgentSpace never writes the TCC database. You approve each grant yourself in the attached account's System Settings." = "AgentSpace 不会写入 TCC 数据库。每项权限都由你在已连接账号的系统设置中亲自确认。";
"This agent is no longer attached. Close this guide and refresh the account list." = "此 Agent 已不再连接。请关闭向导并刷新账号列表。";
"Authorize" = "授权";
"Authorize this account" = "授权此账号";
"This AgentSpace window is running as %@. Authorize the background agentspace-worker for this desktop here." = "当前 AgentSpace 窗口运行在 %@ 账号中，可在这里为此桌面的后台 agentspace-worker 授权。";
"You do not need a second AgentSpace app. The buttons below prepare the worker and open this account's own System Settings." = "不需要安装或寻找第二个 AgentSpace。下面的按钮会准备 worker，并打开此账号自己的系统设置。";
"Authorize Accessibility" = "授权辅助功能";
"Authorize Screen Recording" = "授权屏幕录制";
"The worker is not running yet. The first authorization click installs and starts the current worker before opening System Settings." = "worker 还没有运行。第一次点击授权时会先安装并启动当前 worker，再打开系统设置。";
"The AgentSpace helper is not ready, so the worker cannot be updated yet." = "AgentSpace 助手尚未就绪，暂时无法更新 worker。";
"Sign in to the attached account's desktop once before requesting permissions." = "请先登录已连接账号的桌面一次，再请求权限。";
"The helper did not install the current worker." = "助手没有安装当前 worker。";
"The updated worker was started but did not become ready." = "新版 worker 已启动，但未能进入就绪状态。";
"The worker is still running version %@ instead of %@." = "worker 仍在运行版本 %@，而不是 %@。";
"The worker could not be started in the attached account's desktop." = "无法在已连接账号的桌面中启动 worker。";
"The helper could not prepare the worker: %@" = "助手无法准备 worker：%@";
"If this account has already been attached, refresh this window to reveal its authorization card." = "如果此账号已经连接，请刷新此窗口以显示授权卡片。";
"Permissions for this desktop belong to agentspace-worker, the background process in this account. If this account has already been attached, refresh this window to reveal its authorization card." = "这个桌面的权限属于该账号中的后台进程 agentspace-worker。如果此账号已经连接，请刷新此窗口以显示授权卡片。";
"The worker needs two macOS privacy permissions before it can control the attached desktop. A third, optional grant opens this account's own files." = "worker 需要两个 macOS 隐私权限，才能控制已连接账号的桌面。第三个授权是可选的，用于开放该账号自己的文件。";
"The worker is not running yet. Clicking any permission button will install/start it first, then open the matching System Settings pane." = "worker 还没有运行。点击任一权限按钮后，软件会先安装并启动 worker，再打开对应的系统设置页面。";
"Full Disk Access" = "完全磁盘访问权限";
"Authorize Full Disk Access" = "授权完全磁盘访问权限";
"Open Full Disk Access settings" = "打开完全磁盘访问权限设置";
"Not granted (optional)" = "未授权（可选）";
"Full Disk Access (%@)" = "完全磁盘访问权限（%@）";
"Accessibility and Screen Recording are required. Full Disk Access is optional: without it this account's Desktop, Documents, Downloads and other apps' data stay closed to the worker, which is a working state, not a broken one." = "辅助功能和屏幕录制是必需的。完全磁盘访问权限是可选的：没有它，该账号的桌面、文稿、下载以及其他 App 的数据会对 worker 保持关闭，这是可用的状态，不是故障。";
"The first two are required. Full Disk Access is optional and covers this account's Desktop, Documents, Downloads and other apps' data; without it the agent simply keeps out of those folders." = "前两项是必需的。完全磁盘访问权限是可选的，它涵盖该账号的桌面、文稿、下载以及其他 App 的数据；没有它，Agent 只是不会进入这些文件夹。";
"macOS-protected folders were left out of this figure, not counted as zero. Grant Full Disk Access to include them." = "这个数值不包含 macOS 保护的文件夹，它们也没有被算作 0。授予完全磁盘访问权限后即可包含进来。";
"Optional. Lets agentspace-worker read this account's Desktop, Documents, Downloads and other apps' data. Without it those folders stay closed and the agent works normally everywhere else." = "可选。允许 agentspace-worker 读取该账号的桌面、文稿、下载以及其他 App 的数据。没有它，这些文件夹保持关闭，Agent 在其他方面仍然正常工作。";
